<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cannondale rated accumulate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cannondale rated accumulate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Cannondale Corp with near- and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 1/4 to 19-1/4 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
